      "explanation": "The product \\(2\\cdot3\\cdot4=24\\) is divisible by each denominator. Distributing \\(24\\) across the three fractions therefore turns each term into a whole number:\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n24\\left(\\frac12+\\frac13+\\frac14\\right)\n&=\\frac{24}{2}+\\frac{24}{3}+\\frac{24}{4}\\\\\n&=12+8+6=26.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe value is \\(26\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{E}\\).",
